OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Barber
OL,6,     F5/5. Donald Macleod explores
OL,7,     FBarber's final years when he was
OL,8,     Fsuffering from alcoholism,
OL,9,     Fdepression and cancer.
OL,10,G1700 In Tune
OL,11,     FLegendary pianist Peter Donohoe
OL,12,     Fperforms live in studio. Deborah
OL,13,     FBankole discusses Steel Scenes -
OL,14,     FSouthbank Centre's upcoming
OL,15,     Fcelebration of 75 years of steel
OL,16,     Fpan in the UK.
OL,17,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,18,     FThe fourth of this week's series
OL,19,     Fof Classical Mixtapes featuring
OL,20,     Fmusic in this year's BBC Proms,
OL,21,     Fincluding works by Rossini, Haydn,
OL,22,     FRichard Strauss and Alan Menken.
